# Android player contract

```tsx
// REQUIRED on Capacitor Android
const useEmbed =
  YOUTUBE_IFRAME_PLAYER ||
  (Capacitor.isNativePlatform() && Capacitor.getPlatform() === 'android')
if (useEmbed) return <CleanPlayerYoutubeIframe {...props} />
```

```tsx
// FORBIDDEN on Android — WebView Referer https://localhost freezes after ~1s
el.src = googlevideoUrl
```

Do not add `YoutubeMediaInterceptor` / Range intercept. Do not mid-play `src` swaps (360p→720p).
